WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.031
DNA only gets built one way.

00:00:02.658 --> 00:00:03.331
Here's why.

00:00:04.051 --> 00:00:05.769
Every strand has two different ends.

00:00:06.396 --> 00:00:07.429
The 5-prime end.

00:00:08.056 --> 00:00:09.159
And the 3-prime end.

00:00:10.007 --> 00:00:11.458
New pieces can only snap onto the

00:00:11.528 --> 00:00:12.329
3-prime end.

00:00:13.176 --> 00:00:13.792
One way.

00:00:14.419 --> 00:00:15.115
Every time.

00:00:15.963 --> 00:00:17.832
New DNA only grows from 5-prime to

00:00:17.913 --> 00:00:18.482
3-prime.

00:00:18.703 --> 00:00:19.991
But it can't start from nothing.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:21.652
Swipe.
